            "review_text": "Tom C\n5 contributions\n0\nAmazing Vegan Hidden Gem!\nJun 2024 • Solo\nA very humble restaurant, warm colours and atmosphere. I'm not a vegetarian but the summer rolls were great with one of the best peanut dipping sauce then the Lúc lac is also a must, delicious! Great value for a vegetarian in this area. HIGHLY RECOMMENDED!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 5, 2024",
